            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nzonezererwa cane Uhoraho, umutima wanje uvugirize impundu Imana yanje; kuko yanyambitse imyambaro y’agakiza, akansēsa hejuru umutamana w’ubugororotsi, nk’uk’ umukwe ashazisha igitsibo, kandi nk’uk’ umugeni ashazisha utugenegene twiwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.61.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.61.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 61:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nk’ukw isi ibaduka ibimeze, n’ indimiro imeza ivyayitewemwo, uko ni k’Umwami Uhoraho azomeza ukugororoka n’ishimwe imbere y’amahanga yose.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.61.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.61.11"
            ]
          }
        }
